From: OTB local build <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: mxl862xx: expose OTB flow-control ABI marker

OpenWrt strips optional MODULE_VERSION metadata. Expose a read-only module
parameter instead so the guarded userspace policy can prove that the loaded
MxL driver implements PORTCFGSET and readback before changing pause state.

Signed-off-by: OTB local build <noreply@localhost>
---
--- a/drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c
@@ -4522,6 +4522,12 @@
 	},
 };
 
+static char otb_flowctrl_version[32] = "otb-mxl-flowctrl-v1";
+module_param_string(otb_flowctrl_version, otb_flowctrl_version,
+		    sizeof(otb_flowctrl_version), 0444);
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(otb_flowctrl_version,
+		 "OTB MxL862xx flow-control driver ABI");
+
 mdio_module_driver(mxl862xx_driver);
 
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("Driver for MaxLinear MxL862xx switch family");
